{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2025/02/01.html#a163824","date":1738427904000,"content":"Another <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/Scripting-News/blob/master/blog/opml/2025/01.opml\">month</a>, starting a <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/Scripting-News/tree/master/blog/opml/2025\">new year</a> in the archive on GitHub. <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/Scripting-News/tree/master/blog/opml/2024\">2024</a> is complete. We've been following this pattern long enough. I wish GitHub had existed in 1994, and I wish we understood how to use it sooner than we did. Onward!","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"b811f6f7765c39060213e776469dfdda869b4170bc0addefb3f5d1cb495ec2c3","category":"Sites"}